// spec/cloud/local.md, "Story: Check Alpha's contract on my computer"; spec/cloud/index.md, "Story: Keep Alpha's own cloud ready for the cutover"; spec/cloud/index.md, "Story: Reach my account's services from the app"; spec/cloud/rollout.md, "Story: Deploy an environment without reading a secret into the repository"
